  resultsList:
  - index: 1
    newsTitle: DANGEROUS DANDY
    newsImg: {fileID: -7108302536350650008, guid: 4d6cc64f815d8d54a86d2cdad38c0f32, type: 3}
    lettersList:
    - "To the loathsome, wretched writer of The Weekly Wag, \r\n\r\nYou cad! \r\n\r\nYou
      pauper! \r\n\r\nYou insolent wretch! \r\n\r\nFirst, you show up at my home-
      unannounced! - to harass and badger my family! \r\n\r\nThen, you accuse me-
      whilst I am in the throes of grief- of murdering my beloved brother! \r\n\r\nAnd
      WORST OF ALL \u2013 you condemn me to a life of manacles and striped jumpsuits!
      \r\n\r\nRudeness I can forgive, even incarceration- but stripes?!? You have
      ruined me, sir! And I shall have my revenge! \r\n\r\nMy bunkmate- a most endearing
      fellow who goes by the name \u201CGinger Beer\u201D- has helped me craft my
      first shiv from a particularly stale piece of bread. You can be assured that
      upon my inevitable release from this cell, I will seek you out with the express
      intention of giving you a thorough poking! \r\n\r\nMy idiotic warden tells
      me that I am only permitted to send one letter a month. Well, let me tell you
      this, SIR- you can expect another letter from me one month hence, detailing
      the many other ways in which I will make you suffer! \r\n\r\nYour Mortal Enemy,
      \r\n\r\nMaximillian Hold "
    - Fantastic article kid! Couldn't have written it better myself!
    - 
